# Private / real data — never publish (public repo).
# notes-testing/ ships ONLY the 10 curated demo estimates (bundled as demo content).
# Whitelist them and ignore everything else the app may drop here (real notes,
# HTML exports, archives) so nothing private can leak into a public repo.
notes-testing/*
